              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Persons:</strong> Avi, Bunty, Chandu, Deep, Eliyas, Farukh, Ganesh and Hamid</p>\n\n<p>1. Chandu does not sit at any of the corners.</p>\n\n<p>2. Eliyas sits third to the left of Chandu.</p>\n\n<p><s><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%201.png\" style=\"width: 189px; height: 198px;\" /></s></p>\n\n<p>3. Only one person sits between Eliyas and Farukh.</p>\n\n<p>4. Farukh is not an immediate neighbour of Chandu.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%202.png\" style=\"width: 212px; height: 198px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>5. Hamid is facing outside. Avi is not an immediate neighbour of Farukh and Hamid.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Case 1</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%203.png\" /></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Case 2</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%204.png\" style=\"width: 222px; height: 198px;\" /></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Case 3</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%205.png\" /></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>6. Deep sits third to the left of Ganesh.</p>\n\n<p>(Hence case 1 &amp; case 3 get&nbsp;eliminated because Deep can&rsquo;t be arranged third to the left of Ganesh.)</p>\n\n<p>7. Bunty will sit in the only remaining position.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Case 2.1</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%206.png\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 203px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Case 2.2</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%207.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 203px;\" /></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>8. The number of persons sitting between Bunty and Deep from the right of Deep is the same as that between Deep and Chandu from the left of Deep.</p>\n\n<p>(Hence case 2.1 gets eliminated because there is no one sitting between Deep and Chandu)</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%208.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 203px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/19/10/F1_A.M_M.P_23.08.19_D%209.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 203px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, if Avi is made to face away from the centre of the table,Eliyas would sit to the immediate right of Avi.</p>",
